<h2 id="inherited-subheading">Inherited subheading</h2>
<p><strong>Bold here, and style-false keeps it bold</strong></p>
<p>toggled off by a true in the character style</p>
<p>double toggle cancels to plain</p>
<p>direct off wins absolutely</p>
<p><em>direct on makes this italic</em></p>
